{
  "id": "c1-e07-an-ageing-population",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "An ageing population",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good afternoon. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what role do older people play in your family?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what do you think are the advantages of getting older?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how do you imagine your own life when you are retired?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think older people are treated with enough respect in your country?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5900
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e07-a1",
            "c1-e07-a2",
            "c1-e07-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show older people in different situations. Choose two of the pictures and say what challenges these people might face, and how they might be feeling.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11600
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these situations do you think is the most rewarding for older people?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6700
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e07-b1",
            "c1-e07-b2",
            "c1-e07-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show how older people spend their time. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might gain from these activities, and what difficulties they could face.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12600
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, how can communities help older people avoid feeling lonely?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some issues that arise when populations get older, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10800
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e07-an-ageing-population",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these issues affect a country as its population ages?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7600
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e07-an-ageing-population",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which poses the greatest challenge for governments?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about ageing societies.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Should people be encouraged to work for longer before they retire?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent should families rather than the state be responsible for caring for older relatives?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think younger generations will have to pay a heavy price for an ageing society?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "How can society make better use of the experience and skills of older people?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, is the idea of a retirement age outdated?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, could living in multi-generational homes provide a solution?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e07-an-ageing-population/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
